    "title": "Pet adoption hours at Wags 2 Wishes today",
    "text": "21 hours ago Wags 2 Wishes Animal Rescue at 949 Bell Road, Minooka, IL is open for walk-in visits on 2026-09-26 from 10:00 AM to 3:00 PM for anyone who wants to meet adoptable dogs and a kitten. Visitors can also ask staff about ways to help through volunteering, fostering, or donating, and those with a recent application on file are asked to tell an Adoption Specialist when they arrive.\nThis content is adapted from materials provided by Wags 2 Wishes Animal Rescue\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
